#: luci-theme-vantage/htdocs/luci-static/resources/vantage-theme/nftflow.js:267
msgctxt "vantage-theme"
msgid ""
"Flow offloading is on: once a forwarded connection is established, its "
"packets can skip prerouting, forward and postrouting, so these chains and "
"their counters see only its first packets."
msgstr ""
"流量卸载已开启：一条转发连接建立后，它的数据包可以跳过 prerouting、forward "
"和 postrouting，因此这些链和它们的计数器只会看到该连接最初的数据包。"

#: luci-theme-vantage/htdocs/luci-static/resources/menu-vantage.js:1313
msgid "Follow system theme"
msgstr "跟随系统主题"

#: luci-theme-vantage/htdocs/luci-static/resources/vantage-theme/nftflow.js:39
msgctxt "vantage-theme"
msgid "Forward"
msgstr "转发"

#: luci-theme-vantage/htdocs/luci-static/resources/vantage-theme/nftflow.js:265
msgctxt "vantage-theme"
msgid ""
"Frames bridged between ports of one bridge, such as Wi-Fi and LAN in br-lan "
"on an access point, never reach the input, forward or output chains, and no "
"bridge chain filters them here. (The kernel can hand them to the IP chains "
"if br_netfilter is enabled; the ruleset doesn't show that.)"
msgstr ""
"同一网桥的端口之间桥接的帧（例如接入点上 br-lan 里的 Wi-Fi 和 LAN）永远不会到"
"达 input、forward 或 output 链，这里也没有桥接链会过滤它们。（启用 "
"br_netfilter 时内核可以把它们交给 IP 链；规则集不体现这一点。）"

